{"seq":2,"slug":"metric-threshold-state-machine","title":"绩效阈值分级与账户状态机（Good/At-Risk/Critical）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/account-health-metric-model/metric-threshold-state-machine","wordCount":2985,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"绩效阈值分级与账户状态机-good-at-risk-critical\">绩效阈值分级与账户状态机（Good/At-Risk/Critical）</h1><p>亚马逊的账户健康评级（AHR）把卖家分成「健康 / 有风险 / 不健康」三档并给出 0—1000 积分，eBay 用 12 个月滚动窗口判定 Below Standard，TikTok Shop 用违规积分累进到封店，Shopee 用季度重置的惩罚分——这些机制在工程上是同一个东西：<strong>把一组连续绩效指标映射到离散账户状态，再由状态驱动处罚动作</strong>，区别只在阈值、窗口与滞回策略。把它建成状态机，是「被降权了才知道」变成「降权前 30 天就收到可行动预警」的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从单一红绿灯到多维状态机\">核心概念：从单一红绿灯到多维状态机</h2><p>最早期的卖家绩效系统是一个「红绿灯」：把一个比率和一个阈值比大小，超标就报警。它有三个致命缺陷。<strong>单一指标无法表达复合风险</strong>——订单缺陷率 0.8% 但知识产权违规 3 次的店铺，和缺陷率 1.5% 但零违规的店铺，红绿灯给出相反结论。<strong>点值判定会抖动</strong>——比率在阈值附近每来一单就跨越一次，预警风暴毫无意义。<strong>它只有二元输出</strong>，无法表达「已进入观察期、再触发一次就限流」这种渐进状态，而平台真实处罚恰恰是渐进的。</p>\n<p>状态机把这三点都修掉：输入是<strong>多维度指标向量</strong>（履约、服务、合规、资金风险），中间是<strong>带滞回的阈值分级</strong>，输出是<strong>离散状态</strong>，状态再驱动<strong>动作表</strong>。关键设计是「指标」与「状态」解耦：指标是连续的事实，状态是带记忆的判断，动作是状态的函数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始事件流&lt;br/&gt;订单/索赔/差评/违规/物流] --&gt; B[指标计算层&lt;br/&gt;滚动窗口+EWMA]&#10;  B --&gt; C{阈值分级器&lt;br/&gt;进入/退出双阈值}&#10;  C --&gt;|全部达标且稳定| D[Good 健康]&#10;  C --&gt;|单项越进入阈值| E[At-Risk 有风险&lt;br/&gt;观察期+预警]&#10;  C --&gt;|多项越阈值或持续恶化| F[Critical 危急&lt;br/&gt;限流/资金动作]&#10;  E --&gt;|K 周期内回到达标| D&#10;  E --&gt;|继续恶化| F&#10;  F --&gt;|申诉恢复/指标修复| E&#10;  F --&gt;|申诉失败或再触发| G[Suspended 停用]&#10;  D --&gt;|合规类硬触发&lt;br/&gt;假冒/安全| F\">graph TD\n  A[原始事件流&lt;br/&gt;订单/索赔/差评/违规/物流] --&gt; B[指标计算层&lt;br/&gt;滚动窗口+EWMA]\n  B --&gt; C{阈值分级器&lt;br/&gt;进入/退出双阈值}\n  C --&gt;|全部达标且稳定| D[Good 健康]\n  C --&gt;|单项越进入阈值| E[At-Risk 有风险&lt;br/&gt;观察期+预警]\n  C --&gt;|多项越阈值或持续恶化| F[Critical 危急&lt;br/&gt;限流/资金动作]\n  E --&gt;|K 周期内回到达标| D\n  E --&gt;|继续恶化| F\n  F --&gt;|申诉恢复/指标修复| E\n  F --&gt;|申诉失败或再触发| G[Suspended 停用]\n  D --&gt;|合规类硬触发&lt;br/&gt;假冒/安全| F</pre><p>图里 <code>D → F</code> 的直连是关键：<strong>合规类触发是硬触发</strong>，不参与绩效的平滑过程。一次查实的假冒投诉、一次产品安全召回，会让账户从 Good 直跳 Critical，跳过 At-Risk 观察窗口。这解释了为什么状态机必须区分「可累积的绩效维度」与「不可累积的合规维度」——前者适合迟滞与去抖，后者必须即时生效。</p>\n<p>判定方式从「单指标红绿灯」演进到「加权积分制」（亚马逊 AHR 0—1000）再到「带滞回的多维状态机」，方向是<strong>表达力与抗抖动性同时上升</strong>，代价是可解释性下降——所以好的状态机一定把「为什么是这个状态」显式暴露给运营。积分制并非状态机的替代，而是它的离散化实现：当触发事件本身离散（一次违规、一次迟发考核），用「按次加分」比用「持续比率」更自然，因为分母是次数而非订单量。真实平台常两层并用——绩效比率走状态机，违规事件走积分累进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值的真实口径-平台在用什么数与什么窗口\">阈值的真实口径：平台在用什么数与什么窗口</h2><p>阈值背后是平台对「可容忍坏体验比例」的商业判断。下表汇总主流跨境平台截至 2026 年仍在帮助中心维护的口径，注意<strong>窗口长度差异极大</strong>——这是状态机实现中最易被忽略的工程参数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>阈值口径</th>\n<th>评估窗口</th>\n<th>状态/后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>订单缺陷率 ODR</td>\n<td>&lt; 1%</td>\n<td>60 天滚动</td>\n<td>超阈值 → 账户暂停风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>有效追踪率 VTR / 迟发率 LSR / 售前取消率</td>\n<td>≥ 95% / &lt; 4% / &lt; 2.5%</td>\n<td>30 天滚动</td>\n<td>不达标 → 类目或账户限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>账户健康评级 AHR</td>\n<td>0—99 不健康 / 100—199 有风险 / 200—1000 健康</td>\n<td>按违规积分滚动</td>\n<td>低分或违规 → 停用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay</td>\n<td>交易缺陷率 / 迟发率 / 未解决纠纷率</td>\n<td>进入 Below Standard 的关键项（纠纷率约 0.3% 量级）</td>\n<td>12 个月滚动</td>\n<td>Below Standard → 降权/费用上浮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Walmart</td>\n<td>准时送达率 / 取消率</td>\n<td>约 ≥ 90% / ≤ 2% 量级</td>\n<td>90 天滚动</td>\n<td>不达标 → 绩效警示/下架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok Shop</td>\n<td>店铺体验分 + 违规积分</td>\n<td>分档 + 累进扣分</td>\n<td>按违规累计</td>\n<td>累进到阈值 → 限流/封店</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shopee</td>\n<td>惩罚积分</td>\n<td>分档（1/2/3/6 点…）</td>\n<td>季度重置</td>\n<td>累进 → 上架限制/冻结</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（口径来源：各平台卖家中心公开帮助文档，如 Amazon Seller Central《Account Health》与《Order Defect Rate / Valid Tracking Rate》系列、eBay《Seller Standards》、Walmart《Seller Performance Standards》、TikTok Shop Seller Center 违规积分政策、Shopee Seller Education Hub 惩罚积分政策；平台会调整阈值与窗口，落地前必须以卖家中心当期页面为准。）</p>\n<p>两条工程含义直接读出来：<strong>窗口不同的指标不能共用一套去抖参数</strong>（30 天窗口边界附近的方差远大于 60 天，低分母店铺会频繁抖动）；<strong>「不看截止时间」是最容易踩的坑</strong>（eBay 的 12 个月窗口意味着 11 个月前的缺陷仍在拖累评级，而卖家直觉总是「上个月已经好了」）。状态机必须把「指标值」与「分母充分性」一起暴露，运营才能判断是「真的差」还是「样本太小」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机的工程实现-滚动窗口-滞回与去抖\">状态机的工程实现：滚动窗口、滞回与去抖</h2><p>第一件事是选定<strong>事件时间（event time）语义</strong>。一次订单的「缺陷」可能在索赔裁决当天才确定，而订单发生在 45 天前；若用处理时间入窗，同一个 60 天窗口在不同跑批时刻会给出不同结果，导致状态抖动。正确做法是把事件分配到真正的归属日，并用水位线（watermark）控制「多晚的数据不再改动窗口」。</p>\n<p>第二件事是<strong>滞回（hysteresis）</strong>：给每个阈值配一对门槛——进入坏状态的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与退出坏状态的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{out}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{out} &lt; T_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。以订单缺陷率为例，若达标线是 1%，可取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{in}=1.0\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0%</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{out}=0.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7%</span></span></span></span></span>：越过 1% 进入 At-Risk，要回到 0.7% 以下才恢复 Good，两者之间的带宽就是防止在 1.0% 附近反复横跳的死区。</p>\n<p>第三件事是<strong>平滑</strong>，但要小心用错地方。指数加权移动平均（EWMA）能抑制单日噪声：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t = \\alpha\\, x_t + (1-\\alpha)\\, S_{t-1}, \\quad \\alpha \\in (0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 越小越平滑、滞后越大。把 EWMA 直接当作上报给平台的指标值是错的——平台考核的是真实滚动比率，不是你平滑后的估计。EWMA 与滞回只应服务<strong>内部预警状态</strong>，绝不能反过来影响「平台会怎么判我」。</p>\n<p>第四件事是<strong>小样本的置信处理</strong>。一个只有 30 单的新店，出了 1 单缺陷，ODR 就是 3.33%，远超阈值，但统计上毫无意义。工程上应同时计算两点估计的置信下界，用 Wilson 分数下界替代裸比率做分级输入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LB} = \\frac{\\hat p + \\frac{z^2}{2n} - z\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat p(1-\\hat p)}{n} + \\frac{z^2}{4n^2}}}{1 + \\frac{z^2}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3814em;vertical-align:-1.1514em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.23em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5111em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3175em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\