 class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9164em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2775em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5225em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1514em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是观测比率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是订单量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 是置信分位数（95% 取 1.96）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时下界被拉低，系统不会对新手店误报 Critical；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很大时下界收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，判定回到平台口径。亚马逊也承认某些账户因样本量被特殊处理——这是同一统计直觉的工程实现。</p>\n<p>去抖还有一层是<strong>时间维度的确认（persistence）</strong>：单项指标越线一次不立即升级，要求「连续 K 个评估周期都越线」才升级。代价是响应变慢，收益是把「一次异常大单造成的假警报」挡在门外。K 要和平台的评估节奏对齐：平台按天更新账户健康页，K 取 3—7 天是常见区间；平台按月裁决（如 eBay 的月度评估），K 就以评估周期为单位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态到动作-从预警到资金预留的映射\">状态到动作：从预警到资金预留的映射</h2><p>状态机只有落到动作才有价值。动作表的设计原则是<strong>风险升级与不可逆性成正比</strong>：低状态只做可逆的通知，高状态才动用资金与流量这类难以即时恢复的手段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>内部动作</th>\n<th>卖家可见后果</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Good</td>\n<td>仅记录，无告警</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>At-Risk（越线预警）</td>\n<td>推送预警、生成整改任务、加密集监控</td>\n<td>通常无平台处罚</td>\n<td>完全可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>At-Risk（临近观察期）</td>\n<td>触发人工复盘、准备申诉材料</td>\n<td>可能收到平台提示</td>\n<td>可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Critical</td>\n<td>限流/类目下架预警、启动资金风险评估</td>\n<td>Listing 降权、可能需要资金预留</td>\n<td>部分可逆（需申诉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suspended</td>\n<td>申诉流程、资金解冻申请</td>\n<td>账户停用、余额冻结</td>\n<td>需平台裁决</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中「资金预留」是跨境卖家最痛的一环，也是第二维度必须进状态机的原因。平台在账户出现高风险信号时启动资金预留（reserve）：新账户或长期未经营、缺陷率显著高于同类、绩效短期剧烈恶化、涉及知识产权或欺诈投诉。亚马逊《Funds Reserve / Disbursement》政策说明，预留可能在最后一笔销售后持续至多 90 天，随风险缓解逐步释放——<strong>绩效状态与现金流耦合</strong>，Critical 不仅影响流量，还直接影响可用资金。</p>\n<p>因此状态机应输出<strong>状态向量</strong> <code>{履约, 服务, 合规, 资金风险}</code> 再叠加成总状态，才能表达「履约 Good 但合规 Critical」这类真实错配，而不是把一切压成一个不透明的分数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与可观测性建设\">常见误区与可观测性建设</h2><p>这套状态机落地时反复出现五个误区，每一个都能导致「预警失效」或「预警泛滥」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只用点值快照，不留窗口</td>\n<td>每天数值跳变、无法追溯</td>\n<td>保留滚动窗口与历史序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进入/退出用同一阈值</td>\n<td>阈值附近反复横跳</td>\n<td>引入滞回死区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{out} &lt; T_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忽略分母充分性</td>\n<td>新手店被误判 Critical</td>\n<td>Wilson 下界 + 最小样本门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用 EWMA 值冒充平台口径</td>\n<td>内部显示达标、平台却判罚</td>\n<td>平滑只用于内部预警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可观测性上，状态机必须暴露四个信号：<strong>指标新鲜度</strong>、<strong>分母规模</strong>、<strong>状态变更审计</strong>（谁在何时因哪个指标改了什么状态）、<strong>告警精确率</strong>（预警有多少最终真演变成处罚）。最后一项最易被忽略却决定系统生死：若 At-Risk 预警精确率低于 30%，运营就会集体无视整改流程，状态机沦为昂贵的装饰。与之配套的是<strong>阈值变更治理</strong>：平台会调整阈值与窗口，内部阈值必须版本化，每次状态变更事件记录当时的阈值版本号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>账户健康本质是<strong>多维指标 → 滞回阈值分级 → 离散状态 → 动作表</strong>的状态机，不是单一红绿灯。</li>\n<li>平台口径差异集中在<strong>窗口长度</strong>（Amazon 60/30 天、eBay 12 个月、Walmart 90 天）与<strong>是否用积分累进</strong>（AHR 0—1000、TikTok/Shopee 惩罚分），落地前须逐平台对齐。</li>\n<li>滞回（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{out} &lt; T_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、持续确认（连续 K 窗）、小样本置信下界（Wilson）是三个抗抖动核心手段。</li>\n<li>平滑（EWMA）只服务内部预警，<strong>绝不可</strong>替代上报给平台的真实滚动比率；状态应表达为向量而非标量，以承载「履约达标但合规危急」这类错配。</li>\n<li>状态与现金流耦合：Critical 触发资金预留（如 Amazon 至多 90 天），整改紧迫性高于流量损失；可观测性四件套决定系统是否被运营信任。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本主题所依赖的指标定义与窗口归属见同章 <a href=\"odr-vtr-metric-definition-window\">《ODR/VTR 指标定义与统计窗口》</a>，状态变更事件如何从原始订单与违规流水采集归因见 <a href=\"metric-attribution-data-pipeline\">《指标归因与数据管道》</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"绩效阈值分级与账户状态机（Good/At-Risk/Critical）","id":"绩效阈值分级与账户状态机-good-at-risk-critical"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从单一红绿灯到多维状态机","id":"核心概念-从单一红绿灯到多维状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值的真实口径：平台在用什么数与什么窗口","id":"阈值的真实口径-平台在用什么数与什么窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机的工程实现：滚动窗口、滞回与去抖","id":"状态机的工程实现-滚动窗口-滞回与去抖"},{"level":2,"text":"状态到动作：从预警到资金预留的映射","id":"状态到动作-从预警到资金预留的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与可观测性建设","id":"常见误区与可观测性建设"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"平台卖家账户健康：ODR/VTR 等绩效指标的定义、口径与统计窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/account-health-metric-model/odr-vtr-metric-definition-window"},"next":{"title":"指标归因数据管道与口径漂移处置（Metric Attribution Pipeline & Definition Drift）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/account-health-metric-model/metric-attribution-data-pipeline"}}